&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Push the boundaries of what Coveo can do, one solution at a time&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How do you turn ambitious use cases into real, working solutions that prove their value fast? As a Forward Deployed Engineer, you bring ideas to life through hands-on prototyping, transforming complex requirements into tangible, high-impact solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll operate at the edge of what’s possible with Coveo, working directly with customers and internal teams to validate new use cases, push product boundaries, and shape what comes next, before it reaches production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role supports our DACH customers, working on European business hours. You’ll own a portfolio of accounts, working in German and English, and travelling to customer sites when the engagement calls for it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As our Forward Deployed Engineer, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disambiguate customer needs to shape clear, compelling use cases and solution architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build working prototypes and technical proofs based on approved use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business and architectural requirements into functional, testable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate solution feasibility, performance, and scalability through hands-on experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iterate rapidly on solutions to accelerate production readiness, generating reusable patterns and sharing insights across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary technical owner for assigned DACH accounts, building trusted stakeholder relationships and driving solutions to adoption while working European hours and traveling on-site as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver workshops, requirements sessions, technical documentation, and demos fluently in German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here is what will qualify you for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of hands-on experience in software engineering, system integration, or related fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in both German and English (written and spoken) for customer-facing delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical prototyping skills spanning APIs, data pipelines, and front-end/back-end systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in ambiguous, high-impact environments, combining strong problem-solving skills with a rapid, experimentation-driven mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will make you stand out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with customers in technical, solution-oriented roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate between business context and deep technical execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and drive to explore new approaches and push product capabilities further&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing insights that influence product or platform evolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: &lt;/strong&gt;83,700 EUR to 97,650 EUR&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that the amount of the offer will depend on the candidate’s previous experience and skillset.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do you think you can bring this role to life? Or add your own color?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t need to check every single box; passion goes a long way and we appreciate that skillsets are transferable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Send us your application, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the Coveolife!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage all qualified candidates to apply regardless of, for example, age, gender, disability, gaps in CV, national or ethnic background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description was written by humans, assisted by AI. We may leverage technology in our hiring process to help us see the person behind the resume.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Engineer in our Supply Chain Management organization, you will be responsible for defining, securing, and implementing technical solutions for business problems. You will play a critical role as our systems scale to handle a jump from 1.2 million to over 2.4 million produced boxes per week due to recent software product consolidation. You will look after speeding up development, decision-making, and problem-solving. You will work with our neighboring teams to ensure that our efforts aim to achieve a clearer architecture and boundaries between tech teams to support autonomy. You will communicate directly with our business stakeholders and multiple tech teams supporting local markets. You will report to the Director of Engineering in the Production tribe. This role does not include people management responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assume technical leadership within a tribe and own the most challenging tech decisions, including architecture, design, development, deployment, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the teams in the architectural design and help to maintain architectural integrity in the scope of the tribe and beyond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spend a significant portion of your time orchestrating code generation—guiding AI coding agents, rigorously reviewing their implementations, and refining logic based on organization needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve software problems that have visible risks, roadblocks, and constraints. You will navigate an environment that is approximately &lt;strong&gt;70% greenfield development and 30% legacy systems&lt;/strong&gt;, managing dependencies, data quality, compliance, and architectural transformations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor more junior engineers by fostering a culture of continuous learning and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally, 10+ years of engineering experience, including 2+ years in a staff/principal level capacity and technical leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong capability in working with different stakeholders and experience addressing physical world problems with software solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-Stack &amp;amp; Agentic Engineering: Deep problem-solving skills and full-stack proficiency (e.g., C#, Python, Golang, and modern frontend technologies). You bring hands-on experience leveraging AI coding agents (Cursor, Copilot, Claude Code) in production, moving beyond basic prompting to master context engineering, workflow decomposition, and the implementation of strict guardrails for reliable agent outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data engineering fundamentals is highly desirable, including expertise in data modeling, governance, quality assurance, and proficiency in data processing and storage systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in designing and implementing modular systems, including proficiency in synchronous/asynchronous communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player attitude and a passion for helping others grow through peer-to-peer mentoring, knowledge-sharing sessions, and advocating for best engineering practices, such as CI/CD, TDD, BDD, DDD, and Design Patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An agile mindset with the ability to advocate for cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Interacting with front-end developers, designers, product managers and our teams around the world is very much part of our day-to-day, so communication skills are vital. We are looking for strong problem-solvers who can apply their engineering skills to a wide range of platforms and environments, while also acting as an ambassador to coach team members and stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll receive a competitive salary package, including a HelloFresh-subsidized pension scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy savings on your weekly HelloFresh box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your mental wellbeing with access to platforms like Headspace and Spill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay active with a discounted Urban Sports Club membership and other wellbeing resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance your life with our flexible hybrid model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with sabbatical leave options in addition to standard time off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? &lt;/strong&gt;If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp;We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#Engineering&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW186731910 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW186731910 BCX0&quot;&gt;Awarded 2022’s Best Connectivity Solution, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW186731910 BCX0&quot;&gt;EM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW186731910 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW186731910 BCX0&quot;&gt;nify&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW186731910 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW186731910 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW186731910 BCX0&quot;&gt;does more than link the world&#39;s most cutting-edge devices. It is a place where curiosity is rewarded, collaboration is abundant, and encouraging others is a way of life. We look for innovative human beings who own the process and love people. Just like IoT, we’re all connected.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW186731910 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW186731910 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW186731910 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW186731910 BCX0&quot;&gt;Learn more about us by visiting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;Hyperlink SCXW186731910 BCX0&quot; href=&quot;http://www.emnify.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Underlined SCXW186731910 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW186731910 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;www.emnify.com.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW186731910 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why EMnify?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EMnify is a vibrant, diverse, and upbeat team. We are largely remote, yet we are united by compassion and expansion. We share the desire to maintain our path to revolutionizing the IoT industry now and for the future. We trust you to structure your day in a way that suits your style of representing us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:150,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EM&lt;em&gt;nify’s &lt;/em&gt;development team is growing, and we need your help to shape this growth! With your excellent knowledge of people and interactions as well as processes and tools, we’re betting on you to increase our agility to even higher levels.&lt;br&gt;We don’t just say “flat hierarchies,” we mean it. You’ll work together with a great team of Scrum Masters and Agile Coaches as well as the VPs of Product and Engineering*, and the CTO* (*former Scrum Masters) to help your team achieve its goals and shorten our reaction time to changes in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Activities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Guide and coach the team and organization to in Agile practices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Coach the team and individuals to become self-managed&amp;nbsp;and -organized&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Help improve and scale organizational approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Improve transparency within the team&amp;nbsp;and the overall organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Remove impediments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Keep a safe and trusting environment where conflicts can be managed in healthy ways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Support and coach the Product Management team on Agile practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Support the continuous delivery process of our teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a Scrum Master for at least 5 years in different software development teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good skills and knowledge of continuous improvement, empowerment, transparency and servant leadership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hero moderator who can facilitate and keep participants focused and engaged in meetings&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Agile approaches – Kanban, Scrum, Lean, XP, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling agile processes ( LeSS, Nexus, Safe, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge and experience in Agile development techniques – Automated Testing, User Stories (+mapping), TDD, Continuous Integration, Testing, Pairing/Swarming, Agile Games, Story splitting…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to learn and understand new technical domains quickly&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent English in written and spoken form&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have organized Agile events, or spoken at Agile conferences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefit &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💃 Regular company and team events&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 30 days of holidays&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📖 Free in-house German lessons for our international teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏦 Contribution to the Pension Scheme&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏠 Well-connected offices in Berlin and Wurzburg&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🥤Free beverages in the office&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⛹️‍♀️Urban Sports Subscription Participation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👥 Buddy Program&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
